       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "IMPROVEMENT: Improved teammate positioning in Team Time Trials.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "IMPROVEMENT: Reduced the strictness of opponent marking for the Mountains Classification.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "FIX: Riders could crash for no reason when loading a save.",
